      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768346553533333
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to make a return.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 24096,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768346558266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Can I start with your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768346560066666
    },
    {
      "text": "Sarah Miller. The order is 94B-315.",
