      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 24096,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768346565866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Sarah. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the VeloFit Summit helmet. To get started, could you tell me what specifically is the issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768346568399999
    },
    {
