      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 24096,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768346579199999
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. So, just to be clear, is it a technical fault with the helmet, or a preference regarding the color?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768346580666665
